INSERT INTO `blogs` VALUES (24,'Task Manager App Using Mern','task-manager-app-using-mern','<!-- \nSlug: /task-manager-app-using-mern\nMeta Title: Task Manager App Using MERN – Full-Stack Final Year Project with Source Code, Report & Demo\nMeta Description: Complete your final year with confidence! Download the Task Manager App using MERN stack (MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js) – source code, IEEE report, demo & screenshot. Ideal for BCA, MCA & B.Tech students. Only ₹109!\n-->\n<p>Task Manager App Using MERN &ndash; Full-Stack Final Year Project with Source Code, Report &amp; Demo</p>\n\n<h1>Task Manager App Using MERN &ndash; The Final-Year Project That Guarantees Confidence</h1>\n\n<p><strong>&ldquo;I completed my final-year project in just three days with this code!&rdquo;</strong> If you&rsquo;re racing against deadlines or aiming for top marks in your BCA, MCA, or B.Tech project submission, you&rsquo;re not alone&mdash;and you don&rsquo;t have to risk your grades or sleep. Discover why <strong>over a thousand students trust this exact Task Manager App using the MERN stack</strong>&mdash;and how you can download everything you need (source code + IEEE report) now for just ₹109.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Don&rsquo;t wait until the last week&mdash;your project success story starts here.</strong></p>\n\n<p><a class=\"cta-button\" href=\"#download\">Get Source Code + Report Now for ₹109</a></p>\n\n<h2>What Makes This Project Technically Impressive</h2>\n\n<p>This isn&rsquo;t just another to-do app&mdash;it&rsquo;s a <strong>production-ready full-stack application</strong> built on the most in-demand tech stack:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>MongoDB + Mongoose:</strong> Real-time task storage and retrieval&mdash;no more static data!</li>\n	<li><strong>Express.js (Node.js backend):</strong> RESTful APIs for seamless CRUD operations.</li>\n	<li><strong>React Frontend:</strong> Dynamic UI powered by React Hooks for instant task updates and reactivity.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Main Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Create, edit, and delete tasks with a modern interface</li>\n	<li>Add due dates, set priorities, and track progress at a glance</li>\n	<li>Categorize and filter tasks for effortless organization&mdash;never lose track again!</li>\n	<li><strong>App notifications via bell icon</strong>, so nothing slips through the cracks</li>\n	<li>Create custom lists per project or exam subject for laser-sharp focus</li>\n	<li>Notes section with rich text editing and multimedia attachments&mdash;capture every idea!</li>\n	<li><strong>Dark/Light mode toggle:</strong> Stand out in your viva demo and show off professional UX skills!</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This codebase is built from scratch for academic excellence&mdash;but follows real-world engineering standards so it impresses professors and recruiters alike.</p>\n\n<h2>Step-by-Step Overview of How It Works</h2>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>User Authentication:</strong> Seamless login/register flow handled on both frontend (React) and backend (Node.js + Express).</li>\n	<li><strong>Create/Manage Tasks:</strong> Users can add new tasks specifying title, description, due date, and priority. Tasks update instantly thanks to React state management.</li>\n	<li><strong>Status Tracking:</strong> Mark tasks as pending/completed/in-progress. Filter views by project or category for ultimate clarity.</li>\n	<li><strong>Add Notes:</strong> Attach detailed notes or multimedia to any task&mdash;useful for research projects or multi-stage assignments.</li>\n	<li><strong>Responsive Design:</strong> Demo works flawlessly on desktop and mobile&mdash;show off during viva or placements!</li>\n	<li><strong>Theming:</strong> Toggle between dark and light mode instantly&mdash;a feature professors love seeing in modern UIs.</li>\n	<li><strong>No-nonsense Deployment:</strong> Built using Create React App frontend + Express backend; deploy to Heroku or Render in minutes if needed.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>You&rsquo;ll receive fully functi