-ready.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Saves you from resume rejection:</strong> Get insider tips on how to showcase your best work through GitHub and impactful project documentation.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Makes your projects unforgettable:</strong> Discover how unique, real-world projects spark recruiter curiosity and help you stand out in a sea of &ldquo;Online Voting Systems.&rdquo;</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Kills imposter syndrome:</strong> Real stories prove that even if you&#39;re not from IIT/NIT or feel &quot;average,&quot; applying these skills can still get you those dream offers!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Watch the Full Video on YouTube</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Ready to break free from ordinary prep and unlock the secrets top-paid developers already know? <strong><a href=\"https://youtu.be/5IoSxgK2AG8\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Watch Now on YouTube</a></strong> &mdash; don&rsquo;t let another placement season pass you by.</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"height:0; max-width:100%; overflow:hidden; padding-bottom:56.25%; position:relative\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5IoSxgK2AG8\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:none;\" title=\"Crucial Skills that 30 LPA Developers Know – It\'s Not Just DSA!\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Don&#39;t Stop Here: Explore More FileMakr Resources</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://filemakr.com/final-year-project-ideas\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Best Final Year Project Ideas for B.Tech &amp; MCA Students</strong></a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://filemakr.com/source-code/php\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Download PHP Source Code Projects with Documentation</strong></a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://filemakr.com/btech-final-year-project-report\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>B.Tech Final Year Project Report Samples &amp; Templates</strong></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Your Top Questions Answered: Final Year Student FAQs</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>Is clearing DSA enough to get high-paying software jobs?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No. While DSA helps with initial screening, recruiters also want to see real projects, code quality on GitHub, understanding of system design basics, and strong communication skills. These are what truly set candidates apart for top offers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>I don&rsquo;t have any unique projects yet&mdash;what should I do?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>You don&rsquo;t need an original invention! Start with well-executed versions of real-world problems or remix ideas from platforms like FileMakr. Focus on making your project useful, well-documented, and publicly available on GitHub with a live demo link if possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>I&rsquo;m nervous about explaining my project in interviews. Any tips?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Avoid jargon and keep your explanation simple. Structure your answers around what problem you solved, how you built it, and what impact it had. Practice in front of friends or record yourself for clarity and confidence.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Do freshers really need system design knowledge?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes! Even basic system thinking shows recruiters that you understand how applications work beyond code. Highlight any experience designing database schemas, API endpoints, or handling errors in your projects&mdash;it all counts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>How can I make my resume stand out as a final-year student?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Add a &lsquo;Projects&rsquo; section with direct GitHub links and clear summaries of what each project does. Use straightforward language instead of buzzwords. Show how you applied concepts like system design or teamwork in real scenarios.</p>\r\n','Essential Skills for 30 LPA Jobs: Beyond DSA for Final Year Students','Discover top skills 30 LPA developers use—GitHub, system design, and communication. Final-year coding success starts here!','2025-07-17 08:03:14','null','https://res.cloudinary.com/dikt4rnly/image/upload/v1752739591/hqdrmigd4kkwbcemgmew.png','final year projects, 30 LPA developer skills, coding p