wcharts, tech stack breakdowns, and exhaustive testing cases.</li>\n	<li><strong>Diverse Tech Stack:</strong> The source code is available in multiple programming languages (Java/Python/C#) for flexibility during demos or code explanations.</li>\n	<li><strong>Academic Focus:</strong> Built specifically for M.Tech/BCA/MCA/B.Tech students who need maximum marks without risky last-minute development.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This project demonstrates concepts like user authentication algorithms, image processing logic for password selection/validation, secure session handling, and database integration&mdash;all explained step-by-step in the included report.</p>\n\n<h2>Step-by-Step Overview of How It Works</h2>\n\n<p>The system elevates user security through an intuitive three-step process:</p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><strong>User Registration:</strong> Users select images from a grid at each of the three levels instead of typing a traditional password. The selected sequence is encrypted and stored securely.</li>\n	<li><strong>User Login:</strong> During authentication, users must replicate their unique image sequence across all three levels to gain access.</li>\n	<li><strong>Password Validation:</strong> The backend matches the selected images and their order with encrypted values in the database using robust matching algorithms.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>This approach drastically reduces risks associated with brute-force or dictionary attacks&mdash;making it a perfect academic showcase of modern security principles.</p>\n\n<h3>Main Features Explained</h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>User Interface:</strong> Clean UI built with responsive web technologies&mdash;works smoothly on both desktop and mobile browsers.</li>\n	<li><strong>Database Layer:</strong> Utilizes SQL/NoSQL databases for fast storage and retrieval of image credentials.</li>\n	<li><strong>Error Handling:</strong> Graceful feedback on incorrect logins; logs failed attempts for admin review (covered in report).</li>\n	<li><strong>Testing Suite:</strong> Thoroughly tested using unit, integration, black-box &amp; white-box methods&mdash;all cases documented in the package.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>See the App in Action</h2>\n\n<p>You don&rsquo;t have to imagine what it looks like&mdash;we&rsquo;ve included sample screenshots and a live demo preview so you can see exactly what you&rsquo;re getting before you download.</p>\n\n<p><a class=\"cta-button\" href=\"https://online.visual-paradigm.com/share/book/sample-project-report-1uzumhkivv\" target=\"_blank\">View Live Demo Preview</a><br />\n<br />\nIf you want to see how each step works&mdash;from user registration to multi-level verification&mdash;the demo will give you a clear edge during internal reviews or when explaining to your evaluator.</p>\n\n<h2>Student Success Story/Testimonial</h2>\n\n<div class=\"testimonial\">&ldquo;I was genuinely stressed about my final-year project at NIT Surat. With campus placements coming up and only four days left before submission, I bought the Three Level Image Password Authentication package from FileMakr. The IEEE-format report was so detailed that my professor barely had any questions during viva&mdash;he even praised my understanding of multi-factor authentication! I scored 92/100 in my project evaluation and confidently explained every diagram. Highly recommend this if you want to save time and impress faculty.&rdquo;<br />\n<br />\n&mdash; Priya Menon,<br />\nB.Tech CSE (2025 Batch), NIT Surat</div>\n\n<div class=\"testimonial\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h2>Why It&rsquo;s Perfect for Your Final Year Submission</h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>No More Last-Minute Panic:</strong> Complete report (with all chapters) + source code = ready-to-submit package in less than an hour!</li>\n	<li><strong>IEEE Standard Ensures Maximum Marks:</strong> All sections&mdash;from abstract to bibliography&mdash;follow university guidelines to maximize your academic score potential.</li>\n	<li><strong>No Coding Required:</strong> Even if you&rsquo